---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import Link from "../components/Link.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import thumbsup from "../assets/images/thumbsup.png";
import Heading from "../components/Heading.astro";
import Text from "../components/Text.astro";
import Button from "../components/Button.astro";
---
<MainLayout title="Titel"> 
<section class="relative h-[90vh] flex items-center justify-start overflow-hidden">

  <!-- Background image -->
  <img 
    src="/nythero.png" 
    alt="Hero" 
    class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-[75%_0%] scale-[1.0] lg:object-[75%_70%]"
  />

  <!-- Primary color gradient overlay -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 2xl:hidden bg-gradient-to-t from-[var(--color-primary)] to-transparent" style="top:-80%;"></div>
<!-- Desktop diagonal gradient -->
<div
  class="hidden 2xl:block absolute inset-0"
  style="
    background: linear-gradient(
      to top,
      var(--color-primary) 00%,
      rgba(100,161,153,0.9) 10%,
      rgba(100,161,153,0) 120%
    );
    clip-path: polygon(
      0 -2%,
      28% 0,
      68% 102%,
      0 102%
    );
  "
></div>

  <!-- Content -->
  <div class="relative z-10 text-start max-w-3xl px-4 mt-50 xl:ml-10 2xl:ml-40"
  style="margin-left: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 10rem);">
    <h1 class="font-bold text-white mb-4
           text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl 2xl:text-6xl">
  DONATE A QURAN
</h1>

<h2 class=" text-white mb-40 max-w-[50ch]
           text-base sm:text-lg lg:text-xl 2xl:text-2xl">
  You are an ambassador to Islam no matter what you do, and what better way to be an ambassador to your faith other than donating a gift that cannot be replaced.
</h2>

    <Button href="/donate">DONATE</Button>
  </div>
</section>


	<main>
    <h2 class="mb-10 text-center mt-10">Our Initiative</h2>
    <div class="m-8 mb-20 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-5 lg:max-w-[1200px] lg:mx-auto lg:p-8">

  <!-- Text block: comes first on mobile, second on desktop -->
  <p class="order-1 lg:order-2 lg:col-span-3">
    Education changes everything. 
    <br><br>
    Through your support, we turn donations into action.
    <br><br>
    Every contribution helps fund our journeys to underserved communities where access to education is limited or nonexistent. On the ground, we provide children with free Qurans — giving them knowledge, guidance, and a foundation that reaches far beyond literacy.
    <br><br>
    This is not charity for show. It is a direct investment in children who have been left without opportunity — addressing one root problem that causes many others.
    <br><br>
    Donate with purpose. Help put knowledge into their hands.
  </p>

  <!-- Image card: comes second on mobile, first on desktop -->
  <div class="relative order-2 lg:order-1 lg:col-span-2 aspect-[4/3]">
  <img src="/initiative.png" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover">

  <!-- Top-left label -->
  <span class="absolute top-2 left-0 bg-[var(--color-accent)] text-white px-2 py-1 text-sm">
    Educational needs
  </span>

  <!-- Bottom-right button -->
  <div class="absolute bottom-2 right-2">
    <Button href="/about">Read more</Button>
  </div>
</div>



</div>



<section class="bg-[var(--color-secondary)] p-8">
  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold m-20 text-center">Statistics</h2>

  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-30 mb-20">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center ">
      <img src="/bog.svg" alt="" class="mb-4">
      <p>An estimated 30 million children are out of school in the Middle East and North Africa region, according to UNICEF, risking long-term consequences for their learning and wellbeing.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center ">
      <img src="/cirkeldiagram.svg" alt="" class="mb-4">
      <p>In Gaza, 645,000 children are out of school... at least 84 per cent of schools require full reconstruction or significant rehabilitation before they can reopen.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center ">
      <img src="/personer.svg" alt="" class="mb-4">
      <p class="text-[var(--color-red)] font-bold text-3xl">6 in 10</p>
      <p>In the MENA region, 6 in 10 children cannot read a simple text with comprehension by 10 years of age, increasing the risk of these children dropping out of school forever.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="mt-10 text-center text-sm italic text-gray-400">
  Source: UNICEF, At least 30 million children out of school in the Middle East and North Africa (2025)
</p>
<div class="text-center my-10">
  <Button >Read more</Button>
</div>
</section>

	</main>
	<!-- <main class="container mx-auto p-4">
		<Heading htmlheading="font">DONATE A QURAN</Heading>
        <Text teksttype="brødtekst">Så bliver Anders glad:-)</Text>
	</main> -->
</MainLayout>